WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:26.688
The five princes arrived at the palace.

2
00:00:26.689 --> 00:00:30.230
One was tall and handsome.

3
00:00:30.231 --> 00:00:33.044
One was short and round.

4
00:00:33.045 --> 00:00:36.806
Two princes looked strong and fierce.

5
00:00:36.807 --> 00:00:44.849
One prince was quiet and shy.

6
00:00:44.850 --> 00:00:47.234
They were all polite.

7
00:00:47.235 --> 00:00:56.595
They bowed to Princess Mary.

8
00:00:56.596 --> 00:01:02.145
They talked about the weather.

9
00:01:02.146 --> 00:01:05.020
Tom peered into the Throne Room.

10
00:01:05.021 --> 00:01:08.749
"The princess looks bored," Cat whispered.

11
00:01:08.750 --> 00:01:12.273
"Those princes are being too polite."

12
00:01:12.274 --> 00:01:15.834
"I must do a good spell," Tom said.

13
00:01:15.835 --> 00:01:19.311
He pointed his wand at the princes.

14
00:01:19.312 --> 00:01:22.508
"Let the princess find," he said.

15
00:01:22.509 --> 00:01:24.854
"A prince who is kind!"

16
00:01:24.855 --> 00:01:29.592
Poof! The five princes turned into frogs!

17
00:01:29.593 --> 00:01:32.205
"Oops!" Tom said.

18
00:01:32.206 --> 00:01:35.061
The king stared at the frogs.

19
00:01:35.062 --> 00:01:38.599
"What happened?" he cried.

20
00:01:38.600 --> 00:01:40.657
He spotted Tom.

21
00:01:40.658 --> 00:01:48.346
"Wizard! Did you do this?"

22
00:01:48.347 --> 00:01:51.207
Dirk had an evil smile.

23
00:01:51.208 --> 00:01:56.015
"Throw that wizard in the Grim Dungeon!"

24
00:01:56.016 --> 00:01:59.670
Tom hung his head.

25
00:01:59.671 --> 00:02:03.857
"This is my worst mistake ever!" he thought.

26
00:02:03.858 --> 00:02:06.690
The king looked very worried.

27
00:02:06.691 --> 00:02:11.073
"Tom, turn these frogs back into princes at once!

28
00:02:11.074 --> 00:02:14.102
Their kingdoms will be angry with me.

29
00:02:14.103 --> 00:02:17.402
This could start a Royal War!"

30
00:02:17.403 --> 00:02:19.995
The queen gasped.

31
00:02:19.996 --> 00:02:22.498
"A Royal War?"

32
00:02:22.499 --> 00:02:27.198
Princess Mary was giggling softly.

33
00:02:27.199 --> 00:02:30.647
"I guess you must do it, Tom," she said.

34
00:02:30.648 --> 00:02:33.438
"Turn them back into princes."

35
00:02:33.439 --> 00:02:43.835
Tom bowed. "Of course."

36
00:02:43.836 --> 00:02:49.150
"But I don't know how!" he thought.
